  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">A lyncan of your skills knows how to whip up a meal worth your salt and when a meal’s been tampered with. You gain the Supertaster feat, even if you don’t meet its prerequisites, and you can use your Cooking Lore for its Perception checks. If you Craft food and drink, a creature who partakes in your meal becomes fatigued in twice the time than normal (up to 8 hours) when dealing with climate effects such as temperature, harsh rain or snow, or wind for 24 hours. On a critical success, you also reduce your circumstance penalties to checks when traveling in such climates (up to -2).</span></p>"
